## Current Focus: Frontend Rebuild (Phases 1-2)

**Goal:** Transform basic UI into ADHD-friendly Focus + Navigator modes
**Timeline:** 2 weeks (Jan 1-14, 2026)
**Approach:** Keep backend untouched, rebuild/enhance frontend

**Phase 1 (Week 1):**
- [x] Stats foundation (WritingStats model)
- [x] Enhanced stats footer (5 metrics: word, timer, streak, today, goal)
- [x] Focus Mode layout (EditorView + StatsFooter)
- [ ] Editor enhancements (markdown awareness)
- [ ] Remove toolbar chrome (pure Focus Mode)
- [ ] Keyboard shortcuts (⌘B, ⌘N, ⌘W)
- [x] Session persistence (UserDefaults)

**Phase 2 (Week 2):**
- [ ] Sidebar structure (SidebarView, ProjectSection, RecentSection)
- [ ] Navigation logic (project filtering, note selection)
- [ ] Search/filter implementation
- [ ] Animations & polish (smooth transitions)

**Phase 3-4 (Deferred):**
- Markdown preview (split view)
- LaTeX rendering (MathJax integration)

## Current Version: 0.1.0-dev (Clean Rebuild)

**Build Status:** ✅ Clean (0 warnings, 0 errors, 25s build time)

**Backend:** 100% complete (620 lines, modern Swift)
- DatabaseManager (Actor-based GRDB)
- NoteService, ProjectService (async/await CRUD)
- Models (Note, Project, ScribeError)
- AppState (ObservableObject)

**Frontend:** 40% complete (needs enhancement)
- DesignSystem ✅ (matches vision)
- Basic editor, stats, sidebar (need upgrade)

**Distribution:**
- Platform: macOS 14+ (Sonoma)
- Stack: SwiftUI + GRDB + swift-markdown
- Install: Development only (no distribution yet)

## Recent Sessions

### Jan 1, 2026 (Session 3) - Xcode Project & Bug Fixes
- Created proper Xcode project (eliminates bundle identifier warnings)
  - Installed xcodegen via Homebrew
  - Created project.yml (XcodeGen specification)
  - Created Scribe/Info.plist and Scribe.entitlements
  - Generated Scribe.xcodeproj with `xcodegen`
- Fixed critical bugs:
  - CodingKey bug: Note.swift wordCount → "word_count" mapping
  - Migration bug: Added v3 migration for project columns (color, icon, settings)
  - Database crash: Removed old database with conflicting migration names
- Deep cleaned project:
  - Archived old CLI files (cli/ → archive/cli-tauri-version/)
  - Removed outdated docs (CURRENT_STATUS.md, FRESH_START_SUMMARY.md, etc.)
  - Removed empty directories (Dependencies/, Resources/)
- Build: ✅ Clean (0 warnings, 0 errors, proper .app bundle)

### Jan 1, 2026 (Session 2) - Phase 1 Stats Foundation
- Created WritingStats.swift model (160 lines)
  - Session tracking (timer, word count)
  - Daily tracking (today's words, goal progress)
  - Streak calculation (consecutive writing days)
  - UserDefaults persistence
- Integrated WritingStats into AppState
  - 1-second timer for live session duration updates
  - Auto-save word count tracking
- Created StatsFooter.swift (5 ADHD-friendly metrics)
  - Word count, timer, streak, today's words, goal progress
  - Visual progress bar for daily goal
- Created EditorView.swift (distraction-free editor)
  - Title + content TextEditor
  - 1-second debounced auto-save
  - Live word count updates
- Updated MainView.swift (Focus Mode layout)
  - Editor + StatsFooter composition
  - Creates new note on launch if empty
- Build: ✅ Clean (0 warnings, 0 errors)

